{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1039900-arcadia-the-wyld-hunt-king-ironheart-s-madness","id":1039900,"title":"Arcadia: The Wyld Hunt & King Ironheart's Madness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-29T02:30:37-08:00","id":1039900,"title":"Arcadia: The Wyld Hunt & King Ironheart's Madness","content":"In the mid 1990s, White Wolf produced a Collectible Card Game based on Changeling: The Dreaming, set in the world of Arcadia. I used to play this a lot back in the day, and have recently rediscovered those cards and have been playing it again, introducing some new players to the game. A good friend of mine--and great Changeling fan--with whom I used to play this in the 90s, is currently using the card game as the basis of a role-playing game (which I, sadly, can't be part of, as we no longer live in the same country).<br /> <br /> If you are interested, check out our website: <a href=\"http://arcadiaccg.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://arcadiaccg.wordpress.com/</a><br /> <br /> I've played some Changeling: The Dreaming (second edition) in the past, when it was new, but not as much as I would have liked. I'm looking forward to the 20th anniversary edition, which might help introduce that world to the gaming group I'm currently part of. I've been lurking here for a little while now, but thought I'd jump in and introduce myself. Hi! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12908,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12908-darkyeoman","user":"darkyeoman","date":". 01-29-2017, 05:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12908-darkyeoman","name":"darkyeoman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T05:24:47-08:00","id":1039937,"title":"","content":"The card game is neat - I've managed to track down every card except one! I've only ever played it once though. It has potential, but I think there must have been something I was missing. I'd like to play it more to figure out the proper way to play.<br /> <br /> For its relation to the RPG, the storyline is noncanon, but the cards make for great inspiration. King Ironheart played a major role as a villain in a recent chronicle \ud83d\ude03<br /> <br /> Edit to add: If anyone has a spare Sibylline Swamp to sell or trade, I'd be most interested \ud83d\ude09","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 01-29-2017, 08:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-01T04:23:58-08:00","id":1041761,"title":"","content":"I've got a bunch of cards but never played it. It looks great, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edit